                <pb facs="1142" n="1022" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg1022"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Minister Bowen.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-02-03"><hi rendition="#italic">February 3,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Hay states that the suggestion that the United States enter into a treaty of
                    arbitration to determine what questions may become diplomatic can not be taken
                    seriously. Mr. Bowen will so inform the Venezuelan Government.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
